        "created_at": "2015-03-22T11:54:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You don't have to declare both targets up front, Christopher has said that in the match commentary, but aims must be declared before rolling dice. &nbsp;It wouldn't matter for that attack though, because the defending player can opt not to block dice anyway, so it is a useless aim.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
