        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-23T16:11:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We just had an extensive discussion, and came to the conclusion that Christopher was incorrect in the match feed from PAX East. For Throwing Knives (and similar multi-target attacks), both targets must be declared before dice are rolled. In addition, any aim tokens must be spent before dice are rolled.</p>",
